### Workflows App
### See README.md for setup instructions.
### The workflow backend (actors or DTS) is determined by the --resources-path used with dapr run.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@instanceId = order-001

### Start a PlaceOrder workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/StartWorkflow/PlaceOrder/{{instanceId}}

### Get workflow status
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{instanceId}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### Send events to the PlaceOrder workflow (send in order)
### -------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Change the purchase item
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{instanceId}}/ChangePurchaseItem/stapler

### 2. Confirm size, color, and address (all three required — WhenAll)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{instanceId}}/ConfirmSize/large

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{instanceId}}/ConfirmColor/red

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{instanceId}}/ConfirmAddress/123-Main-St

### 3. Choose a payment method (any one of these — WhenAny)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{instanceId}}/PayByCard/visa

### -------------------------------------------------------
### Monitor workflow
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Start a second PlaceOrder workflow to be monitored
POST {{baseUrl}}/StartWorkflow/PlaceOrder/order-002

### Start a monitor that watches order-002
POST {{baseUrl}}/StartMonitorWorkflow/order-002/monitor-001

### Get monitor status
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor-001

### -------------------------------------------------------
### Lifecycle operations
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Pause a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/PauseWorkflow/{{instanceId}}

### Resume a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/ResumeWorkflow/{{instanceId}}

### Terminate a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/TerminateWorkflow/{{instanceId}}

### Purge a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/PurgeWorkflow/{{instanceId}}
